imized/1X/2925c59eec70b16315ef18b3cf08394c91e25c16_2_1035x504.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/2925c59eec70b16315ef18b3cf08394c91e25c16_2_1380x672.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1E2023\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">grafik</span><span class=\"informations\">2250\u00d71096 162 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>RAM usage remained flat, but CPU spiked:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/afbcee52262f0cf60409e24efe5a112c40bba443.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/afbcee52262f0cf60409e24efe5a112c40bba443\" title=\"grafik\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/afbcee52262f0cf60409e24efe5a112c40bba443_2_429x500.png\" alt=\"grafik\" data-base62-sha1=\"p4El4Yc5g35Wh2cigeFcMIk4hGP\" width=\"429\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/afbcee52262f0cf60409e24efe5a112c40bba443_2_429x500.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/afbcee52262f0cf60409e24efe5a112c40bba443_2_643x750.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/afbcee52262f0cf60409e24efe5a112c40bba443_2_858x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"15161A\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">grafik</span><span class=\"informations\">1140\u00d71326 41.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
